# KIPPER: polyps let out filchers while the sub tows something; a filcher
# snatches the last thing in the trail and swims home with it, and drops it
# when pacified. A bloater close by puffs out shots and clouds; a cloud
# knocks the last thing in the trail loose, and a sinker bomb knocked loose
# goes off.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
cheat tile 70 28
wait 2
cheat take 10
cheat foe 1 1060 456
wait 120
expect trail == 0
expect held == 1
expect item10_where == 3
expect foe85_carry == 10
cheat hurtfoe 85 4
expect held == 0
expect loose == 1
expect item10_where == 2
# swim into it: in tow again
cheat tile 66 28
wait 5
expect trail == 1
expect item10_where == 1
# a bloater close by: shots and clouds every way; a cloud knocks the trail
cheat clear
cheat god
cheat tile 66 28
wait 2
cheat take 11
hold RIGHT 40
cheat foe 11 1075 456
wait 90
expect trail < 2
expect loose >= 1
# a sinker bomb knocked loose goes off
cheat fit 3
cheat dock 0
wait 25
press A
wait 5
press B
wait 5
cheat clear
cheat tile 66 28
wait 2
expect trail_charges == 2
hold RIGHT 40
cheat foe 11 1075 456
wait 4
expect eshots_1 >= 6
wait 90
expect trail_charges < 2
# a polyp sends a filcher after bombs in tow too
cheat clear
cheat tile 66 28
wait 2
expect trail_charges >= 1
cheat foe 0 1000 456
waituntil foes_1 >= 1 300
